    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as Mitchelle, a 6-month pregnant woman who is staying in the house with her husband and is involved in a mysterious story. During the game you will visit unsettling places that will cause feelings of fear, anxiety, psychological terror and discomfort. You will have to accomplish specific objectives within the game and rescue the soul of your baby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you will encounter events that will create tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: 40 ~ 60 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good plot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS aesthetics</p></li></ul>",
